# P7: the ordered stop after an unplug finds Monado hung: never SIGKILLed, the gate latches needs-reboot, the user
# is told the choices, and nothing restarts on replug.
start desk
sim monado_hangs=1
at 10 down usb.hid usb.cam usb.eye display.dp1
expect 17 ran stop-subtree monado
expect 21 gate needs-reboot
expect 21 notified was NOT killed
expect 21 overall needs-reboot
at 100 up usb.hid usb.cam usb.eye display.dp1
expect 200 runs 1
